# Gradio UI and orb

- **Hero styles** (`mystic`, `aether`, `neural`) use **vendored Three.js / WebGL** (`ui/orb_webgl.js` + `ui/vendor/three.min.js`). No CDN.
- **Classic styles** (`lightning`, `mist`, `nebula`, `nebula+lightning`) stay pure canvas JS.
- Persist orb config via the settings store; preserve calm ↔ thinking transitions.
- Keep particle counts capped (see `docs/mockups/orb_styles.md`).
- One UI slice at a time (presets, panels, chat polish). Do not rewrite the whole Gradio app in one PR.
- Cards and extra chrome only when they aid interaction; match the existing dark theme.
